       - Both lazy-construct the underlying PyOD model from the baseline on
     first call, cache it on the instance, refit when baseline length changes.
     - app/anomalies/service.py — orchestration: run_anomaly_check(record: 
     HRRecord, baseline: dict[str, list[float]], min_cohort_size: int = 5) -> 
     list[AnomalyScore]. Runs both detectors; a record is "consensus anomalous"
     when both detectors flag it. Records with no departement or no salaire_brut
     return [].
