       - test_baseline.py covers grouping, min-size, skipping partial records.
       - test_detectors.py covers deterministic scoring and consensus semantics.
       - test_service.py covers end-to-end of run_anomaly_check against
     synthetic cohorts.
     2. Integration test — tests/anomalies/test_integration.py::test_pipeline_em
