       - Assert JobState.statut is the same as it would have been without
     anomaly (GREEN stays GREEN).
       - Re-run with the same repo state but only 2 pre-existing records in the
     department: assert flag_anomaly_baseline_unavailable is emitted instead.
     3. Regression — pytest tests/ -q (full suite) must remain green.
